cholarships and Discounts Inbound student mobility Outbound student mobility Accommodation Visa and medical insurance Life in Budapest and Hungary Contact us University About Corvinus Maecenas Universitatis Corvini Foundation Organisation Institutes Departments Senate, University Committees Campuses Gellért Campus Corvinus Doctoral Schools Whistleblowing reports Regulations, Provisions, Directives Non-Regulatory Documents Ethics, Responsibility, Sustainability Corporate partners Contact Research Corvinus Research Neuro- and Digital Marketing Research Center (NEDIMARC) Corvinus Institute for Advanced Studies Regional Centre for Energy Policy Research Research Centres CCL at Corvinus University University Library University Archives Research and development projects Scientific Students’ Associations Conference (TDK) Journals, working papers, repositories Corvinus Science Shop Students For Freshers International and Administrative Student Services MyCorvinus Navigator Makerspace Media Studio Scholarship Student’s Union Doctoral Student Council Digital advances at Corvinus Students Satisfaction Evaluation Using Artificial Intelligence For our current students Accommodation Student Organisations IT Services Student support services Career support Sport and health Schedule of the Academic Year Subjects Alumni News News Events Success Stories Media Library International Blog Career support Corvinus University of Budapest offers various opportunities and services aimed at supporting students and recent graduates as they define their career goals and transition successfully from campus to a global career. Corvinus University of Budapest offers various opportunities and services aimed at supporting students and recent graduates as they define their career goals and transition successfully from campus to a global career. Unlock your Career Toolkit – powered by CareerOS Everything you need to build your career with purpose – all in one place, empowering you to move confidently toward your professional goals. Find internships and jobs faster Improve your CV in minutes Connect with strategic partners, industry professionals and alumni Discover careers you didn’t know existed Build your career before graduation. Set up a career appointment You can read more about using CareerOS here . If you need help, please email careeradvising@uni-corvinus.hu . Career advising and employability services Experienced career advisors assist you as you make career choices and develop the skills, attitudes and knowledge needed to successfully transition into the world of work. Individual consultations, group activities – focused on career exploration, skills assessment, CV/resume review, networking, internship and job search, interview preparations and more, as well as relevant information in the Career Newsletter and on the Job board , help you become career-ready. More about the career advising and employability services Career advising and employability services Experienced career advisors assist you as you make career choices and develop the skills, attitudes and knowledge needed to successfully transition into the world of work. Individual consultations, group activities – focused on career exploration, skills assessment, CV/resume review, networking, internship and job search, interview preparations and more, as well as relevant information in the Career Newsletter and on the Job board , help you become career-ready. More about the career advising and employability services Career counselling and psychological support Professional psychologists and counsellors can support you from a self-knowledge perspective, when you need to discuss your concerns about your professional life-path, you need some help in finding out what you really want, or articulating your interests, values and motivation, when usure about continuing studies or pursuing work, or whenever you feel something is going wrong in your professional life. More about career counseling and psychological support Career counselling and psychological support Professional psychologists and counsellors can support you from a self-knowledge perspective, when you need to discuss your concerns about your professional life-path, you need some help in finding out what you really want, or articulating your interests, values and motivation, when usure about continuing studies or pursuing work, or whenever you feel something is going wrong in your professional life. More about career counseling and psychological support Navigator Navigator is Corvinus University of Budapest’s smart, data-driven platform designed to guide you through your academic journey and support your career planning. By taking a short assessment, you’ll get a detailed overview of your key strengths and relevant career options. The platform’s personalized life path planner also recommends courses, student organizations, and extracurricular activities that match your interests and abilities. In addition, one-on-one consultations—like profile interpretation, mentoring, or career advising—offer deeper insights about yourself, allowing for more confident, informed decisions about your future. To Navigator Navigator Navigator is Corvinus University of Budapest’s smart, data-driven platform designed to guide you through your academic journey and support your career planning. By taking a short assessment, you’ll get a detailed overview of your key strengths and relevant career options. The platform’s personalized life path planner also recommends courses, student organizations, and extracurricular activities that match your interests and abilities. In addition, one-on-one consultations—like profile interpretation, mentoring, or career advising—offer deeper insights about yourself, allowing for more confident, informed decisions about your future. To Navigator Mandatory Internships The Internship Office provides you with all the important information you may need to organize your internship. In one place, you can find all the necessary documents, forms, and deadlines. To Internship Office Mandatory Internships The Internship Office provides you with all the important information you may need to organize your internship. In one place, you can find all the necessary documents, forms, and deadlines. To Internship Office Mobility Programs Corvinus University of Budapest offers its students the opportunity to complete their internships abroad through the mobility solutions available via the Pannonia Program. The aim of the program is to help students acquire the skills needed in the labor market and to gain insight into the economic and social culture of the host country through the time spent at a foreign organization. To Mobility programs Mobility Programs Corvinus University of Budapest offers its students the opportunity to complete their internships abroad through the mobility solutions available via the Pannonia Program. The aim of the program is to help students acquire the skills needed in the labor market and to gain insight into the economic and social culture of the host country through the time spent at a foreign organization. To Mobility programs News, events Gain Research Experience Abroad 2025.09.04. Are you a PhD student? Apply for the research mobility program! Interested in a pre-degree international internship? Look out for this Pannonia Programme is launching soon! 2025.08.11. Would you like to gain professional experience abroad? The Pannonia Internship Programme for the first semester of the 2025/26 academic year is launching soon – Copied to clipboard Manage consent Contact Us Telephone: +36 1 482 5000 Do you have questions about the admissions? Academic Contacts For current students HUB Press: press@uni-corvinus.hu Useful information Opening Hours House Rules Public Data Career at Corvinus Design Elements RRF Public data Follow us Facebook LinkedIn Youtube Instagram TikTok X International accreditations Main international memberships Cookie & Data M