      "description": "Login - CAS – Central Authentication Service Login Login C USMAN P assword Login Login Login C USMAN P assword CAPSLOCK key is turned on! Forgot your password? Static Authentication CAS is configured to accept a static list of users for primary authentication. This is ONLY useful for demo purposes. It is recommended that you connect CAS to LDAP, JDBC, etc instead. Cookies Disabled Your browser does not support cookies. The browser's ability to store or read cookies is essential for single sign-on to work. Please consult your browser settings and ensure cookie support is turned on. HTTP This service definition authorizes all application urls that support HTTP protocols. Resources cas.login.resources.dashboard Documentation Pull Requests Contributor Guidelines Mailing Lists Chatroom Blog Copyright © 2005–2022 Apereo, Inc. Powered by Apereo Central Authentication Service 5.3.7 2021-05-28T14:11:22Z"
